Branching on time-window selection Both trees can branch on the number of times each time window of a vertex isselected, following Li et al. (2020, Transportation Research Part E 140,101955, Section 6.3). Enable it with the time resource: let mut tree = baldes::master::tree::TreeOptions::default();
